      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T19:41:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m taking over this CL in order to get this tracepoints landed. In order to target the latest Trusty branch I\u0027ve had to create a new CL https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/1990690. I\u0027ve addressed the initial comments in that CL.",
      "revId": "3b6b7debc9c834ea4936035c76c49b13ae9fe580",
