        "id": 1902326
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-14T19:40:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After some experimentation in the code and some futher discussion with Arve, I\u0027m inclined to go with the single trace event that Tri suggested. The only exception to this is the `trusty_std_call32` event, since that captures a higher level flow that may include multiple `smc()` calls.",
