      "key": {
        "uuid": "ad8f375f_dd87a715",
        "filename": "drivers/trusty/trusty.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 206,
      "author": {
        "id": 1124693
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-06T06:43:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The other tracepoints surround smc() call. What\u0027s different here?",
      "revId": "3b6b7debc9c834ea4936035c76c49b13ae9fe580",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cefdf996_42594010",
        "filename": "drivers/trusty/trusty.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 206,
      "author": {
        "id": 1902326
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T19:41:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This tracepoint and the corresponding `trace_trusty_std_call32_done` tracepoint surround  `while` loop that repeatedly calls `trusty_std_call_helper`. If I\u0027m understanding it correctly, we need to repeatedly perform `smc()` calls in case Trusty is interrupted in order to ensure that it has enough time to complete whatever operation was requested. So having this tracepoint span the entire sequence of repeated `smc()` calls will help give us a high level picture of how long it took to complete the operation.",
      "parentUuid": "ad8f375f_dd87a715",
      "revId": "3b6b7debc9c834ea4936035c76c49b13ae9fe580",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6226e4c6_402f14f6",
        "filename": "drivers/trusty/trusty.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 206,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000205
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-18T23:23:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. trusty_std_call_inner, which is what where the tracepoints around the smc call related to trusty_std_call32, can be called many times per trusty_std_call32 call.",
      "parentUuid": "cefdf996_42594010",
      "revId": "3b6b7debc9c834ea4936035c76c49b13ae9fe580",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
